WEBVTT

00:07.040 --> 00:08.920
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:34.840 --> 01:38.920
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:43.000 --> 01:44.000
Her Ladyship！

01:44.080 --> 01:46.080
You can't take Her Ladyship away!

01:46.680 --> 01:47.880
Let Her Ladyship go!

01:47.960 --> 01:49.520
Release Her Ladyship!

01:50.680 --> 01:51.760
Let her go!

01:51.840 --> 01:53.760
Release Her Ladyship!

01:53.840 --> 01:55.160
They want to take Her Ladyship away

01:55.240 --> 01:57.040
and destroy the home
where we've found refuge.

01:57.120 --> 01:58.320
Will we stand for that?

01:58.400 --> 02:01.560
-No!
-No!

02:01.640 --> 02:04.240
-Drive them out! Save Her Ladyship!
-No!

02:05.200 --> 02:08.160
-Fight them!
-Fight!

02:09.199 --> 02:10.440
Stop them!

02:20.800 --> 02:23.040
Protect me! Protect me!

02:23.120 --> 02:25.160
Save Her Ladyship!

02:26.120 --> 02:27.320
Protect me!

02:28.800 --> 02:30.600
Protect me!

02:30.680 --> 02:32.200
Fight them!

02:33.920 --> 02:34.760
Run!

02:34.840 --> 02:36.000
Protect me!

02:51.280 --> 02:54.440
Protect me! Protect me!

02:59.960 --> 03:01.840
-Aman!
-This way!

03:01.920 --> 03:02.840
Let's go!

03:11.920 --> 03:13.160
Get away!

03:13.240 --> 03:14.280
Guards!

03:14.360 --> 03:17.920
-Protect Her Majesty!
-Protect me! Protect me!

03:20.640 --> 03:21.760
Guards!

03:28.680 --> 03:29.520
Your Majesty.

03:40.360 --> 03:41.960
Here's the old wretch!

03:45.400 --> 03:46.320
Your Majesty.

03:47.040 --> 03:49.360
How could a mere girl like Wei Rao…?

03:53.680 --> 03:54.520
Let's go.

04:01.800 --> 04:03.160
Faster!

04:11.480 --> 04:12.800
It is you!

04:17.399 --> 04:19.720
-What about me?
-You faked your illness to trick us.

04:20.320 --> 04:21.720
It was all a lie.

04:21.800 --> 04:24.480
This was all a trap to lure us out!

04:40.280 --> 04:41.840
It's only a minor illness.

04:43.400 --> 04:45.040
Even if I went to hell,

04:45.880 --> 04:48.280
I'd crawl back out
and drag you down with me.

04:49.080 --> 04:51.040
I owe you my thanks, my dear cousin.

04:51.760 --> 04:54.000
Your greed and cruelty forced my hand

04:54.080 --> 04:57.640
and gave me every reason
to catch you all in one fell swoop.

04:58.320 --> 05:01.040
Just for Hongxian, some lowly maid,

05:01.640 --> 05:04.280
and to protect those beggars,
you'd go this far?

05:05.640 --> 05:09.240
You've betrayed the Wei family
and your noble blood.

05:09.320 --> 05:11.720
You've brought utter disgrace
on our family!

05:17.560 --> 05:18.760
How dare you hit me?

05:19.360 --> 05:21.680
Noble blood? What a joke.

05:21.760 --> 05:23.400
My father died fighting for this country.

05:23.480 --> 05:25.160
A hero's blood runs in my veins.

05:26.040 --> 05:30.320
And you used the honor he paid for
in blood to marry into royalty,

05:30.400 --> 05:33.280
then turned around
and trampled on his daughter.

05:33.960 --> 05:37.320
Your horses
trampled the people's fertile fields.

05:37.400 --> 05:40.280
You betrayed the people
who sustain the nobility

05:40.920 --> 05:43.680
and the country
made up of those millions of people.

05:44.400 --> 05:46.520
You're the real traitors.

05:47.920 --> 05:48.960
Wait.

05:50.200 --> 05:51.360
Where's the Crown Prince?

06:01.600 --> 06:02.720
Go! Move!

06:03.360 --> 06:05.240
Your Highness, the road is blocked.
What should we do?

06:05.840 --> 06:08.480
They're just ahead!
Don't let a single one escape!

06:20.960 --> 06:22.480
How dare you plot
against the Crown Prince!

06:23.200 --> 06:24.600
I won't kill him.

06:25.200 --> 06:27.800
But he's abused countless girls.

06:27.880 --> 06:29.640
He must be punished.

06:29.720 --> 06:30.680
I'll make sure he never

06:30.760 --> 06:33.000
gets the chance
to take the throne in this lifetime.

06:33.080 --> 06:34.160
You…

06:34.240 --> 06:36.520
And for all your scheming
and helping him commit his crimes,

06:37.160 --> 06:38.760
you'll never become Empress either.

06:39.720 --> 06:40.720
Wei Rao,

06:41.840 --> 06:43.280
I'll make you pay!

06:53.400 --> 06:55.480
Your Ladyship, this woman
has committed every evil.

06:55.560 --> 06:57.040
Let her bleed to death.

06:57.560 --> 06:59.920
-Carry her back.
-Yes.

07:18.240 --> 07:21.280
Set traps in the east, south, and west.

07:21.360 --> 07:23.200
Leave the north open
so the Empress Dowager can escape.

07:23.960 --> 07:25.120
What about the Crown Prince?

07:28.760 --> 07:29.960
What do you think?

07:39.520 --> 07:42.440
Help! I've broken my leg!

07:43.400 --> 07:44.800
Help! My leg is broken!

07:46.240 --> 07:49.240
Help me. Get me out. My leg is broken!

07:49.320 --> 07:50.160
Bring a rope.

07:55.640 --> 07:56.840
Hurry.

08:04.840 --> 08:05.720
Hurry.

08:06.320 --> 08:07.480
Pull me up.

08:09.080 --> 08:11.840
Once I'm out, I'll reward you.

08:11.920 --> 08:13.360
Pull me up!

08:20.040 --> 08:20.880
Hurry!

08:29.360 --> 08:31.520
I'll tear you limb from limb!

08:32.120 --> 08:36.159
Your Highness, you made women
dance barefoot on burning coals

08:36.760 --> 08:38.120
and laughed with delight.

08:38.760 --> 08:40.039
You never would've imagined

08:40.120 --> 08:42.840
that one day,
you'd be at someone else's mercy too.

08:43.480 --> 08:44.320
Enjoy it.

08:46.640 --> 08:48.800
No! Don't leave me here!

08:48.880 --> 08:50.160
Help!

08:51.160 --> 08:54.480
Don't leave me here! Help me.

08:54.560 --> 08:56.040
Help!

08:56.120 --> 08:59.320
Get me out! I'll give you gold!

08:59.400 --> 09:00.960
Help!

09:03.800 --> 09:06.320
Help… Help me.

09:08.320 --> 09:10.760
-Let's go.
-Help me! I'm begging you!

09:10.840 --> 09:12.680
Don't leave me here!

09:12.760 --> 09:14.880
I know I was wrong!

09:15.480 --> 09:16.400
Your Majesty.

09:18.720 --> 09:19.560
Be careful.

09:35.920 --> 09:37.160
Lu Zhuo?

09:44.320 --> 09:45.800
Greetings, Your Majesty.

09:45.880 --> 09:46.840
What happened here?

09:46.920 --> 09:49.040
The rabble have rebelled. Hurry.

09:49.120 --> 09:50.120
Arrest them at once!

09:52.600 --> 09:53.640
My Lord, it's Her Ladyship.

10:02.480 --> 10:07.360
My dear, while you were away,
they all ganged up on me.

10:08.560 --> 10:09.640
Lies!

10:09.720 --> 10:11.760
You silver-tongued, venomous snake!

10:12.720 --> 10:15.400
Han Liao coerced Madam Liu,
duped the Empress Dowager.

10:16.240 --> 10:17.800
He accused me of a forged identity

10:17.880 --> 10:19.560
and deceiving His Majesty.

10:20.080 --> 10:21.960
He even tried to parade me
through the streets,

10:22.040 --> 10:23.960
which angered the people.

10:24.040 --> 10:25.320
In their outrage,

10:26.200 --> 10:28.920
they overturned the imperial carriage
and frightened Her Majesty.

10:29.760 --> 10:30.800
I see.

10:31.880 --> 10:35.320
Lu Zhuo, you're an imperial official.

10:35.400 --> 10:38.280
You mustn't let personal feelings
lead you to cover for this woman.

10:38.360 --> 10:41.080
Her Majesty has ordered you
to arrest the rebels!

10:41.680 --> 10:43.400
The estate has sheltered
countless refugees.

10:44.200 --> 10:45.960
If Your Majesty wants me
to arrest them all,

10:46.040 --> 10:49.920
I'm afraid prisoners will fill the streets
and pack the prisons.

10:50.000 --> 10:52.360
Even ten more imperial prisons
won't hold them all.

10:52.440 --> 10:54.280
Don't play dumb.

10:54.800 --> 10:55.960
Her Majesty wants to arrest

10:57.520 --> 10:58.920
Noble Lady Wu'an's accomplices!

11:00.280 --> 11:02.680
My wife's growing reputation
draws people from far and wide.

11:03.360 --> 11:06.440
Even from miles away,
people keep coming to seek her protection.

11:07.200 --> 11:08.240
Tell me, in all the realm,

11:08.880 --> 11:10.120
who with a conscience

11:10.200 --> 11:12.400
is her ally?

11:12.480 --> 11:14.360
And who isn't?

11:15.480 --> 11:19.400
Lord Lu, this woman has blinded you.

11:20.000 --> 11:22.320
You even dare defy my decree now.

11:23.240 --> 11:26.320
Both she and her mother are seductresses!

11:29.480 --> 11:30.360
I feel dizzy.

11:31.200 --> 11:32.200
I'll take you back.

11:40.640 --> 11:43.440
You…

11:44.560 --> 11:46.120
Your Majesty!

11:46.200 --> 11:47.880
Back to the palace!

11:49.520 --> 11:52.200
-Guards!
-Escort me back to the palace!

11:53.280 --> 11:55.800
Lu Zhuo, this isn't over.

11:56.800 --> 11:59.880
When His Majesty returns,
you'll answer for this.

12:10.680 --> 12:12.560
He's taking my horse!

12:15.240 --> 12:16.080
Satisfied?

12:17.840 --> 12:19.560
I just want to piss off that old witch.

12:28.000 --> 12:30.040
You're burning up,
yet you're still running around?

12:30.680 --> 12:32.840
-I still have business to take care of.
-We're going back.

12:39.520 --> 12:41.640
CAISHU HALL

12:41.720 --> 12:46.720
ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

13:04.840 --> 13:07.960
First, tell me where
you're holding the Crown Prince.

13:08.800 --> 13:11.360
That Crown Prince is such a coward.

13:11.440 --> 13:14.000
The people gave him a fright,
and he vanished without a trace.

13:14.080 --> 13:16.640
I don't know where he is now.

13:27.760 --> 13:30.360
I'll find him even if you won't tell me.

13:32.400 --> 13:33.480
Where's my grandmother?

13:35.480 --> 13:36.360
She's in a guest room.

13:36.960 --> 13:39.600
I should go and see her
so she won't worry.

13:48.240 --> 13:51.200
Aman,
go and tell Grandmother I'm all right.

13:51.880 --> 13:53.440
I must rest and recover,

13:55.560 --> 13:58.040
-as my husband says.
-Yes.

14:32.560 --> 14:36.840
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

14:37.680 --> 14:39.000
Where is the Crown Prince?

14:39.520 --> 14:42.320
-Lord Lu, we haven't…
-Think twice before you answer.

14:43.400 --> 14:45.440
Lady Rao has caused a major crisis.

14:46.040 --> 14:47.920
If you won't tell me the truth now,

14:48.000 --> 14:50.320
she'll have to defend herself
before His Majesty while ill.

14:50.840 --> 14:51.760
She's seriously ill.

14:53.840 --> 14:54.920
Do you want to kill her?

14:55.920 --> 14:58.360
Lord Lu, I'll tell you the truth.

14:58.880 --> 15:01.960
The Crown Prince ran off blindly
and accidentally fell into a hunting pit.

15:03.520 --> 15:04.880
I rushed back to tell Her Ladyship.

15:04.960 --> 15:08.240
I was just about to fetch ropes
and a sedan chair to bring him back.

15:10.120 --> 15:11.920
Of all the things
you could learn from her,

15:12.000 --> 15:14.480
you've learned only how to evade questions
and deceive people.

15:15.960 --> 15:16.960
You speak truly, my Lord.

15:18.920 --> 15:20.200
Come along!

15:24.080 --> 15:25.880
CHANGLE PALACE

15:25.960 --> 15:30.160
Why haven't you sent troops to rescue
the Crown Prince and arrest Wu'an?

15:30.240 --> 15:34.640
Han Liao,
do you mean to defy my decree too?

15:35.880 --> 15:36.720
Please, Your Majesty.

15:36.800 --> 15:39.480
My life and fortunes
depend entirely on you.

15:40.120 --> 15:41.760
How could I dare disobey?

15:42.560 --> 15:45.160
We can't hide this uprising
from His Majesty.

15:45.240 --> 15:46.880
He has surely been informed by now.

15:46.960 --> 15:49.520
Wei Rao incited the people to rebel.

15:49.600 --> 15:50.760
That crime warrants the extermination
of her entire clan.

15:52.040 --> 15:54.160
His Majesty won't spare her.

15:54.760 --> 15:56.120
What about the Crown Prince?

15:56.720 --> 15:59.800
He's His Majesty's own son.

16:00.320 --> 16:01.520
However grave his crimes,

16:01.600 --> 16:03.360
only His Majesty can judge his case.

16:03.960 --> 16:05.640
Others have no right to interfere.

16:05.720 --> 16:09.280
Wei Rao would never dare
kill His Highness.

16:09.360 --> 16:12.080
At most,
she'll make him suffer a little longer.

16:12.680 --> 16:16.560
You said we could charge her with treason?

16:16.640 --> 16:17.640
ETERNAL SPLENDOR

16:17.720 --> 16:19.640
As the ringleader of this treason,

16:20.720 --> 16:22.720
she should die by slow slicing.

16:24.640 --> 16:28.200
She's brought this on herself.

16:43.040 --> 16:46.200
Traitor! You traitor!

17:03.400 --> 17:07.240
Lord Lu, please have me
taken home to recover.

17:08.119 --> 17:10.640
Zhao Song, escort His Highness home.

17:11.640 --> 17:12.599
Yes.

17:25.119 --> 17:27.359
Lu Zhuo, Wu'an,

17:28.040 --> 17:32.120
one day I'll tear you both limb from limb
and grind your bones to dust!

17:40.320 --> 17:43.560
Lord Lu,
the Crown Prince fell by accident.

17:45.840 --> 17:46.800
You think I'm buying that?

17:47.400 --> 17:49.520
Her Ladyship said,
"If we're going to do this,

17:49.600 --> 17:51.040
we must finish it for good.

17:51.720 --> 17:52.880
Leave him to rot in that pit

17:52.960 --> 17:54.640
until nothing remains but bones
in a decade.

17:54.720 --> 17:55.920
Even if the truth comes out,

17:56.000 --> 17:59.520
taking the Crown Prince down with us
would make dying worthwhile."

17:59.600 --> 18:00.680
Just shut it, okay?

18:01.280 --> 18:03.000
She'd never settle for mutual destruction.

18:03.720 --> 18:05.120
Surely plotting something else.

18:06.360 --> 18:09.520
Lord Lu, they say
birds of a feather flock together.

18:09.600 --> 18:12.520
You really do know Her Ladyship
inside out.

18:20.760 --> 18:24.400
Well, well, of course
this is your idea, Wei Rao.

18:25.640 --> 18:26.760
You naughty girl!

18:26.840 --> 18:28.680
You nearly scared me to death!

18:28.760 --> 18:30.320
Grandmother, keep your voice down.

18:30.400 --> 18:31.520
Don't let him hear you.

18:31.600 --> 18:35.080
You've taken on the Crown Prince
and the Empress Dowager.

18:35.160 --> 18:37.920
You're fearless!
Who are you afraid to be heard?

18:38.000 --> 18:41.320
Lu Zhuo. He's terrifying
when he scolds me.

18:45.200 --> 18:47.400
So a man can keep you in line after all?

18:47.480 --> 18:48.880
Is that all you've got?

18:52.920 --> 18:55.080
You're always the kindest to me,
Grandmother.

18:55.680 --> 18:57.400
I shouldn't have kept things from you.

18:57.480 --> 18:59.960
If you want to hit me, go ahead.

19:00.040 --> 19:01.200
I…

19:04.520 --> 19:06.120
Oh, you!

19:06.200 --> 19:08.680
You've got such a wicked mind!

19:08.760 --> 19:12.600
Even good old wood ash
couldn't scrub it clean.

19:13.400 --> 19:15.680
He's the Crown Prince, you know.

19:15.760 --> 19:18.040
Are you really not afraid?

19:18.120 --> 19:19.920
I hear the Crown Prince
has broken his leg.

19:20.600 --> 19:22.560
In the 150 years since our dynasty
was founded,

19:22.640 --> 19:24.080
never seen a crown prince so low

19:24.160 --> 19:25.680
and so morally crippled.

19:27.560 --> 19:29.920
No reckless talk
of the Crown Prince's rise or fall.

19:30.000 --> 19:31.560
You're the one who said it.

19:38.880 --> 19:41.640
The Empress Dowager has long resented me.

19:41.720 --> 19:44.000
She'll stop at nothing to have you killed.

19:44.800 --> 19:47.400
What do you plan to do next?

19:50.720 --> 19:52.680
Here's what we'll do.

19:52.760 --> 19:56.840
ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

19:57.880 --> 20:00.280
XUANSHI PALACE

20:03.640 --> 20:04.680
Your Majesty.

20:10.160 --> 20:12.200
I know the whole story now.

20:12.880 --> 20:15.440
How badly is your leg injured?

20:15.520 --> 20:17.840
Father, please give me justice.

20:17.920 --> 20:19.160
ZHENG TAN, GRAND COMMANDANT,
LADY ZHENG'S ELDEST BROTHER

20:19.240 --> 20:24.240
Your Majesty, Wu'an incited the mob
to beat the Crown Prince so severely.

20:24.320 --> 20:26.800
The imperial physicians say his leg
is beyond repair.

20:26.880 --> 20:28.600
He may never walk normally again.

20:29.560 --> 20:32.200
General Han and the Imperial Guards
can testify to this.

20:32.280 --> 20:35.920
I beg Your Majesty to punish
the ringleader, Noble Lady Wu'an.

20:36.800 --> 20:39.840
Then what punishment do you propose?

20:41.360 --> 20:45.120
Your Majesty, first, Wu'an led a mob
against Her Majesty's procession,

20:45.200 --> 20:46.160
showing disrespect.

20:46.760 --> 20:50.640
Second, she incited the refugees to riot,
which amounts to treason.

20:51.680 --> 20:53.960
Wu'an, as the ringleader,
should die by slow slicing.

20:54.600 --> 20:56.080
All her followers should be hanged.

20:56.160 --> 20:58.680
Make an example of them to deter others.

20:59.600 --> 21:04.400
So, the Crown Prince,
the Grand Commandant, and Han Liao

21:04.480 --> 21:06.320
all call for the death penalty?

21:10.040 --> 21:12.280
We humbly await Your Majesty's judgment!

21:16.440 --> 21:17.280
XUANSHI PALACE

21:17.360 --> 21:20.240
How can I persuade Father
to show my sister mercy?

21:20.320 --> 21:21.680
Zhuo.

21:23.200 --> 21:24.240
My brother-in-law?

21:24.760 --> 21:28.560
You needn't say anything, Your Highness.
You don't need to plead for Wei Rao.

21:29.480 --> 21:31.120
Everyone wants Rao dead.

21:31.200 --> 21:33.120
Her life is at stake.
How can I stay silent?

21:35.720 --> 21:39.000
Love for your siblings is only natural,

21:39.080 --> 21:41.320
but you must also consider
your bond with your father.

21:42.480 --> 21:45.720
Sometimes, silence
speaks louder than any argument.

21:47.000 --> 21:50.760
Think carefully about what I've said,
and you'll know what to do.

22:03.760 --> 22:04.640
How is Rao?

22:05.240 --> 22:07.240
Have the two imperial physicians I sent
examined her?

22:07.840 --> 22:09.760
Summon them. I'll talk to them myself.

22:09.840 --> 22:11.120
I took the physicians there,

22:11.200 --> 22:16.000
but Her Ladyship was gravely ill
and too distressed to see anyone.

22:20.320 --> 22:21.600
Everyone, leave us.

22:26.280 --> 22:29.960
Your Ladyship, Noble Lady Wu'an
had a maid lie in bed in her place.

22:30.040 --> 22:31.480
She wasn't at the estate at all.

22:37.320 --> 22:38.920
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

22:41.880 --> 22:43.320
Water.

22:45.880 --> 22:46.960
Anyone?

23:11.320 --> 23:13.880
Shu, I've come to visit you.

23:15.240 --> 23:18.160
You kindly helped the Crown Prince
devise his plans,

23:18.240 --> 23:19.760
yet he took his anger out on you,

23:19.840 --> 23:22.040
refused to let you recover
in his residence.

23:22.120 --> 23:23.800
Here you are,
unwillingly on Wei's property.

23:28.080 --> 23:29.840
How heartless of him.

23:32.880 --> 23:34.000
What?

23:35.120 --> 23:38.560
Now everyone at Xuanshi Palace
wants you dead.

23:38.640 --> 23:41.920
Instead of clinging to Lady Li
and begging for mercy,

23:42.000 --> 23:45.040
you are here to enjoy the show
at my expense?

23:52.520 --> 23:55.600
GRACE OF AUTUMN, HEART OF VIRTUE

23:59.360 --> 24:00.880
Trying to beg my forgiveness?

24:02.440 --> 24:03.920
Too late.

24:04.000 --> 24:08.440
I'll watch the executioner
slice the flesh from your bones!

24:08.520 --> 24:09.360
Shu,

24:10.520 --> 24:12.080
we're both recovering from illness.

24:12.160 --> 24:13.880
We both have time on our hands.

24:14.760 --> 24:15.840
Why don't we play a game?

24:16.440 --> 24:17.920
What game?

24:18.720 --> 24:20.440
How about we make a bet?

24:22.000 --> 24:23.800
Will His Majesty have me killed or not?

24:24.680 --> 24:28.160
And the stakes? Your life.

24:28.760 --> 24:32.200
You injured the Crown Prince,
attacked Her Majesty's procession,

24:32.280 --> 24:34.280
and led a rebellion.
Your crimes are unforgivable.

24:35.080 --> 24:36.680
You still think you can escape death?

24:38.120 --> 24:40.240
You're deluding yourself!

24:47.360 --> 24:48.520
This is the Crown Prince.

24:54.840 --> 24:56.480
This is the Fourth Prince, Liu Shuo.

25:01.520 --> 25:04.520
Liu Shuo,
have you come to plead for your sister?

25:07.400 --> 25:12.200
Father, before I entered,
I had so much to say in her defense.

25:12.920 --> 25:14.360
But now that I'm here,

25:14.880 --> 25:17.320
I see how weary you look
and how much weight you've lost.

25:18.040 --> 25:19.760
You haven't fully recovered,

25:19.840 --> 25:21.600
yet you rushed back
to the palace overnight.

25:21.680 --> 25:24.760
My heart aches to see you ill, Father.

25:24.840 --> 25:26.360
I can't take your place in suffering

25:26.440 --> 25:27.280
that alone is the deepest unfiliality.

25:27.880 --> 25:30.960
I dare not plead for my sister
and add to your worries.

25:34.760 --> 25:35.600
Rise.

25:36.440 --> 25:39.440
You're still young.
Stand aside and listen.

25:40.800 --> 25:42.840
People always favor their youngest sons.

25:43.640 --> 25:46.280
But the Crown Prince
is the heir to the throne.

25:46.960 --> 25:49.200
He commands great respect
and has saved His Majesty's life.

25:49.800 --> 25:52.400
Liu Shuo? He's not even
worthy to be compared.

25:53.000 --> 25:59.040
Besides, the Crown Prince has
the Zheng family behind him.

26:02.280 --> 26:05.960
Lu Zhuo, the Lu family
has always been loyal, brave,

26:06.040 --> 26:07.320
and a pillar of the realm.

26:07.400 --> 26:09.400
Would you really betray
His Majesty's favor

26:10.080 --> 26:13.400
and disregard the law
because of one woman?

26:14.080 --> 26:16.240
When the people of Liangzhou
and Bingzhou rose up,

26:17.160 --> 26:19.120
His Majesty was furious and
had those land-grabbing clans executed

26:19.720 --> 26:21.800
and pardoned the people who rebelled.

26:21.880 --> 26:24.880
What an emperor fears
isn't peasants armed with farm tools

26:26.600 --> 26:28.080
but the loss of their support.

26:29.240 --> 26:30.400
As heir to the throne,

26:30.480 --> 26:32.480
the Crown Prince stormed the estate
to settle a private grudge.

26:33.840 --> 26:35.920
He provoked the people's outrage.

26:36.000 --> 26:37.680
Lu Zhuo, how dare you!

26:37.760 --> 26:39.560
Lord Lu wants to argue that
the law can't punish the many,

26:39.640 --> 26:41.040
to get Her Ladyship off the hook.

26:41.120 --> 26:43.760
But in that case,
powerful men drove the people to revolt.

26:43.840 --> 26:46.480
Wu'an, however, deliberately
incited the ignorant masses.

26:46.560 --> 26:49.200
That is treason! Rebellion!

26:49.760 --> 26:51.360
The two cases are entirely different!

26:51.440 --> 26:53.640
Wu'an endangered the realm
and incited a revolt.

26:53.720 --> 26:55.600
She must die, Your Majesty!

26:58.920 --> 27:00.160
Take a look, Your Majesty.

27:03.560 --> 27:06.040
The Imperial Guards took a shortcut
through the fields

27:06.760 --> 27:08.960
and trampled vast
stretches of wheat seedlings.

27:09.040 --> 27:11.320
But these are more than seedlings.

27:11.400 --> 27:13.880
They embody the people's trust

27:14.840 --> 27:16.920
that Your Majesty
works day and night to restore.

27:17.000 --> 27:18.560
Lu Zhuo!

27:18.640 --> 27:20.800
From ancient times,
those with farm tools are honest folk

27:20.880 --> 27:23.000
and those bearing weapons
have been outlaws.

27:23.680 --> 27:27.280
Who overturned her carriage?
Was it angry folks

27:27.800 --> 27:29.120
or rebellious outlaws?

27:29.800 --> 27:30.720
Lu Zhuo…

27:30.800 --> 27:34.040
Your Majesty rules with mercy,
cautious in punishment and execution.

27:34.120 --> 27:36.440
Wu'an sheltered refugees
and reclaimed farmlands.

27:37.200 --> 27:40.120
You drove those farmers
to take up their tools as weapons.

27:41.960 --> 27:44.960
You. You are the ones to blame.

27:45.600 --> 27:46.960
You're the real traitors here.

27:47.760 --> 27:50.520
Father, I…

27:52.400 --> 27:54.680
I only went because
I heard Wu'an had a fake identity.

27:55.200 --> 27:57.280
I didn't know, Father!

27:58.600 --> 28:02.880
An heir so foolish and incompetent,
who has lost the people's support.

28:02.960 --> 28:06.160
How can I entrust him with the realm
and the people's welfare?

28:07.800 --> 28:09.400
Father, please show mercy.

28:09.480 --> 28:12.160
Spare my sister and those desperate folk.

28:20.560 --> 28:21.600
The Lu family?

28:22.400 --> 28:23.880
Oh, Wei Rao,

28:24.480 --> 28:26.560
Lady Li has schemed for years,

28:26.640 --> 28:28.480
yet the title of Empress
is beyond her reach.

28:28.560 --> 28:30.600
All because the Zhou family
has no powerful backer

28:31.360 --> 28:33.080
to speak for her at court.

28:34.360 --> 28:37.480
I have to admire
the wonderful marriage alliance

28:37.560 --> 28:39.760
you've secured for yourself.

28:43.480 --> 28:45.920
No? What have I got wrong?

28:46.800 --> 28:50.440
Lu Zhuo wouldn't let his feelings
for me override the law

28:50.960 --> 28:52.120
for any personal gain.

28:52.720 --> 28:55.480
If not the Lu family, then what?

28:58.280 --> 28:59.240
Lord Lu.

28:59.960 --> 29:01.280
The Heir of Duke of Ying.

29:01.360 --> 29:03.640
So just and impartial,
free of personal bias,

29:03.720 --> 29:04.840
XUANSHI PALACE

29:04.920 --> 29:08.520
has now let a woman
make him disregard the law.

29:10.520 --> 29:13.200
I never thought I'd see the day.

29:14.400 --> 29:18.560
Lu Zhuo, you once condemned me
for being corrupt,

29:18.640 --> 29:20.040
for lining my own pockets.

29:20.120 --> 29:22.840
Doesn't what you've done today
make you a hypocrite?

29:25.000 --> 29:27.960
You think His Majesty is hesitating
because of the Lu family?

29:28.920 --> 29:29.960
Isn't he?

29:35.480 --> 29:36.760
What's the most disappointed

29:37.360 --> 29:39.680
was that, to settle a private grudge,

29:39.760 --> 29:42.720
the Crown Prince openly displayed
his brutality, petty-mindedness,

29:42.800 --> 29:44.760
and lawlessness before all the people.

29:45.760 --> 29:48.120
The moment the Crown Prince's cavalry
set foot in Zhuyu Estate,

29:48.880 --> 29:50.720
he'd already fallen into Wei Rao's trap.

29:52.120 --> 29:58.560
His Majesty could never allow
a foolish incompetent to be his heir.

30:03.760 --> 30:09.000
So he lost to me in goodwill, in justice,

30:09.600 --> 30:11.440
and in people's support.

30:16.880 --> 30:18.440
There's still someone

30:19.160 --> 30:21.600
who can sway His Majesty
and decide the outcome.

30:23.600 --> 30:27.560
Wei Rao, you can't win.

30:30.240 --> 30:32.520
The Empress Dowager wants you dead.

30:33.840 --> 30:37.320
Mother, I've been here for you so long.

30:37.400 --> 30:39.320
Please eat at least a little.

30:40.000 --> 30:41.960
Yes, my brother is wrong.

30:42.040 --> 30:43.480
I'll have him come here,

30:43.560 --> 30:45.360
and you can scold him all you like.
All right?

30:46.160 --> 30:49.040
He's rebellious to the bone.

30:49.120 --> 30:52.120
Whatever I tell him, he does the opposite.

30:52.200 --> 30:54.840
How is he my son?

30:54.920 --> 30:58.200
He's more like
that wretched Lady Zhou's child.

31:02.240 --> 31:03.080
Leave us.

31:03.160 --> 31:05.400
CELESTIAL SPLENDOR

31:06.520 --> 31:09.960
Mother, you mustn't say such things.

31:10.040 --> 31:11.840
You'll break His Majesty's heart.

31:11.920 --> 31:14.000
Greetings, Your Majesty.

31:14.600 --> 31:18.480
Now that he's Emperor, he's forgotten

31:18.560 --> 31:21.560
the mother who bore and raised him,
his own flesh and blood.

31:22.280 --> 31:24.800
It's as if he's bewitched.

31:24.880 --> 31:26.840
He favors an official's wife,

31:26.920 --> 31:29.440
dotes on another man's daughter,

31:29.520 --> 31:31.840
and cares nothing for his own son.

31:32.600 --> 31:37.640
At heart, he resents me, his mother,

31:37.720 --> 31:42.480
and treats that lowly wet nurse
as his own mother instead.

31:43.320 --> 31:44.360
Have you forgotten?

31:48.440 --> 31:49.440
We've got Lady Shou'an.

31:56.800 --> 32:00.000
Mother, are you truly my mother?

32:02.040 --> 32:05.080
How dare you say such a thing?

32:06.400 --> 32:09.480
Ever since I can remember,
only my wet nurse was there for me.

32:10.080 --> 32:14.000
Where was my own mother when I needed her?

32:15.440 --> 32:19.960
Back then, life in the palace
was a constant struggle.

32:20.600 --> 32:25.400
Keeping you and your brother safe
was no easy task.

32:25.480 --> 32:27.560
How could I attend to everything?

32:27.640 --> 32:30.360
Do you still resent me over such trifles?

32:30.440 --> 32:31.920
Is that really how it was?

32:32.960 --> 32:37.520
I remember how my brother and I went to
the lake without our wet nurse knowing

32:37.600 --> 32:39.000
and fell into the water.

32:40.000 --> 32:42.600
We were rescued,
but both became seriously ill.

32:42.680 --> 32:48.240
During the half month I lay ill,
you stayed by my brother's side.

32:48.320 --> 32:49.040
‎YUNIANG, YOUNG LADY SHOU'AN

32:49.120 --> 32:51.040
Did you ever think of me?

32:51.120 --> 32:53.600
As the six-year-old Seventh Prince,
I couldn't understand.

32:54.800 --> 32:57.480
We were brothers born of the same mother.

32:58.800 --> 33:04.440
Why did you favor one so much
and neglect the other?

33:06.520 --> 33:08.040
Later, I understood.

33:09.600 --> 33:14.040
My brother
was talented and adored by Father.

33:14.960 --> 33:17.600
He was your greatest asset
in the struggle for power.

33:18.280 --> 33:22.440
And I was nothing more
than a foolish child.

33:23.040 --> 33:27.000
How could I compare with the brother
who could bring you glory and power?

33:29.000 --> 33:31.400
Only when he died young of illness

33:32.000 --> 33:37.880
and all your hopes were dashed
did you finally think of me.

33:39.720 --> 33:43.960
Even if I neglected you
and treated you coldly,

33:45.160 --> 33:47.440
you're still my own flesh and blood.

33:48.720 --> 33:50.600
Mine!

33:50.680 --> 33:53.400
You shouldn't have grown close
to a wet nurse

33:54.560 --> 33:56.320
or granted that wretch a title.

33:57.080 --> 34:00.640
You've let the whole world know
that the Emperor

34:01.240 --> 34:03.800
treats his wet nurse as his own mother.

34:03.880 --> 34:06.880
You even brought her widowed daughter
into the palace.

34:07.400 --> 34:09.760
How you've humiliated me!

34:10.600 --> 34:14.199
So, you want to kill her,

34:15.000 --> 34:18.239
the woman who fed your son
with her own milk and raised him.

34:19.239 --> 34:23.440
who risked her life again and again
to protect me?

34:27.400 --> 34:29.600
She never tried to take your place.

34:31.080 --> 34:33.239
She kept telling me the same lie.

34:34.280 --> 34:37.280
She said, "Your mother is very busy.

34:37.880 --> 34:39.440
She'll come soon."

34:40.440 --> 34:41.880
But you never did.

34:41.960 --> 34:43.719
Not once.

34:45.199 --> 34:49.000
Yes, she fulfilled your duties
as a mother.

34:50.000 --> 34:52.440
But her place in my heart

34:53.480 --> 34:55.679
was one you willingly gave up.

34:56.600 --> 34:58.280
That's ancient history.

34:59.080 --> 35:00.640
There's no point dwelling on it.

35:07.280 --> 35:13.320
Your Majesty, the whole world saw
that mob overturn my imperial carriage.

35:13.400 --> 35:17.760
If you regard me as your mother
and this country's Empress Dowager,

35:18.440 --> 35:23.760
you must uphold my dignity
and execute Wu'an, the ringleader.

35:25.440 --> 35:28.880
Kill her! I order you to kill her!

35:29.400 --> 35:30.760
Your Majesty!

35:32.000 --> 35:33.120
Your Majesty!

35:36.400 --> 35:39.400
Your Majesty, Lady Shou'an
has entered the palace.

35:48.360 --> 35:49.640
Your Majesty…

35:53.040 --> 35:54.840
An emperor has only one mother.

35:56.040 --> 35:58.840
I am the one who gave birth to you!

36:02.320 --> 36:05.760
Wei Rao must die.

36:07.200 --> 36:08.800
She must die!

36:14.800 --> 36:15.800
Your Majesty.

36:18.040 --> 36:20.000
Hasn't Lady Shou'an arrived?

36:24.800 --> 36:26.160
Mother was here.

36:26.880 --> 36:29.760
She brought a basket of spring
delicacies she'd prepared herself.

36:29.840 --> 36:35.000
She hoped to cheer you up
and persuade you to pardon Rao.

36:44.960 --> 36:48.480
If she came to plead, why did she leave?

36:49.440 --> 36:52.520
I told Mother you were unwell.

36:53.360 --> 36:57.600
I've told you to stop taking elixirs,
but you won't listen.

36:57.680 --> 37:00.080
Mother grew anxious when she heard.

37:00.680 --> 37:01.880
She hurried home,

37:01.960 --> 37:03.920
saying she had to find something
called Baoyuan Pills,

37:04.720 --> 37:08.400
that they were made using a renowned
Jiangnan physician's secret recipe,

37:08.480 --> 37:11.240
and that they could restore vitality
and cure all ailments.

37:11.320 --> 37:14.320
She'd originally been saving them for Rao.

37:14.400 --> 37:17.200
Afraid the maids wouldn't find them,
she went to fetch them herself.

37:23.600 --> 37:27.240
She still remembers
how much I like these wild scallions.

37:33.240 --> 37:34.800
They taste just as I remember.

37:42.920 --> 37:45.160
Aren't you going to plead
for your daughter?

37:46.280 --> 37:48.480
Many at court now see her as a threat.

37:49.080 --> 37:52.600
They say she incited a revolt
and has great ambitions.

37:54.240 --> 37:55.600
That's easily solved.

37:55.680 --> 37:57.880
Depose the Crown Prince
and let Shuo take his place.

37:58.480 --> 37:59.800
She's Shuo's own sister.

37:59.880 --> 38:02.520
-Would she rebel against her own brother?
-How dare you!

38:03.520 --> 38:07.960
Yes, I've overstepped
and meddled in state affairs.

38:08.040 --> 38:10.080
Have my head, Your Majesty.

38:11.840 --> 38:13.800
All right. That's enough.

38:13.880 --> 38:15.640
How many times have I told you?

38:16.680 --> 38:18.040
Don't let your feelings show.

38:18.760 --> 38:21.800
However turbulent they are,
keep your composure.

38:21.880 --> 38:23.200
But you?

38:23.280 --> 38:25.600
You just can't keep your thoughts
to yourself.

38:25.680 --> 38:27.200
If I weren't protecting you,

38:27.280 --> 38:29.720
they'd have devoured you, bones and all!

38:30.760 --> 38:32.280
Listen. From now on,

38:32.360 --> 38:35.560
those private thoughts
must never be shared with outsiders.

38:44.400 --> 38:45.880
Actually, Your Majesty,

38:46.400 --> 38:49.160
it doesn't matter
whom you name Crown Prince.

38:49.840 --> 38:51.640
May Your Majesty live a long life,

38:51.720 --> 38:54.400
so my children and I
can enjoy lasting peace.

38:58.000 --> 39:00.240
Elixirs may preserve youth
and prolong life,

39:00.320 --> 39:04.080
but they're potent and weaken the body
with prolonged use.

39:04.160 --> 39:06.280
You should take less of them.

39:09.200 --> 39:10.240
I know.

39:16.440 --> 39:17.520
Your Majesty,

39:19.280 --> 39:20.880
are you really going to kill my daughter?

39:33.920 --> 39:37.600
Ask no further. I'll make my own decision.

39:38.240 --> 39:39.080
XUANSHI PALACE

39:39.160 --> 39:41.480
Wei Rao has committed a monstrous crime.

39:42.000 --> 39:46.320
I don't believe
you can save her this time.

39:48.640 --> 39:51.520
Whether she lives or dies,
is executed or spared,

39:52.120 --> 39:53.400
we'll know soon enough.

39:55.360 --> 39:56.800
Why the rush, Lord Han?

40:06.280 --> 40:07.280
Here it comes.

40:12.000 --> 40:13.720
Emperors are human too.

40:14.240 --> 40:16.720
Humans weigh the costs and benefits.

40:18.320 --> 40:20.360
On one side, the Crown Prince,
the Zheng family, and the Empress Dowager.

40:20.960 --> 40:24.440
On the other, Liu Shuo,
the people's support, and Lady Shou'an.

40:25.640 --> 40:29.600
Once he's weighed them,
which side will he choose?

40:33.600 --> 40:36.000
Perhaps I was born a gambler.

40:37.400 --> 40:38.920
I'm betting His Majesty will…

40:44.600 --> 40:46.840
Your Ladyship,
a decree has arrived from the palace.

40:46.920 --> 40:48.080
"The Crown Prince let his troops
destroy crops and harm the people.

40:48.680 --> 40:50.880
He is ordered to compensate the people
in full for their lost grain.

40:51.480 --> 40:52.960
Noble Lady Wu'an
failed to maintain discipline

40:53.040 --> 40:54.440
and allowed her people
to frighten the Empress Dowager.

40:54.520 --> 40:56.200
In view of her illness,

40:56.280 --> 40:59.000
her punishment is limited to forfeiture
of three years' stipend

40:59.080 --> 41:01.480
and house confinement
to reflect on her conduct."

41:11.360 --> 41:12.880
I won.

41:12.960 --> 41:17.200
Why? Why won't he kill you
even after all this?

41:18.480 --> 41:21.160
The heaviest weight on your side
is the Empress Dowager.

41:21.240 --> 41:23.040
She may be His Majesty's birth mother,

41:23.560 --> 41:26.040
but years of coldness and distance
have weakened that bond.

41:26.120 --> 41:28.320
It cannot outweigh
the stability of his realm.

41:29.640 --> 41:31.000
His beloved consort, youngest son,

41:31.080 --> 41:33.160
wet nurse's care,
and the people's support.

41:33.240 --> 41:34.880
He wants them all.

41:36.520 --> 41:38.120
That's the Emperor.

41:39.440 --> 41:40.640
That's human nature.

41:40.720 --> 41:42.920
Shut up!

41:45.240 --> 41:46.400
Shu,

41:48.560 --> 41:49.800
the game's over.

41:49.880 --> 41:51.480
No!

41:52.000 --> 41:54.680
You haven't won! You haven't!

42:01.280 --> 42:02.520
There's still a chance.

42:03.560 --> 42:05.160
There must be.

42:07.280 --> 42:11.280
Wei Shu, you can't concede.

42:13.560 --> 42:16.120
You mustn't let this break you.

42:29.160 --> 42:31.320
ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

42:31.400 --> 42:32.240
Where have you been?

42:38.400 --> 42:39.880
You're back, my dear.

42:40.720 --> 42:43.000
-I went to visit Grandmother.
-Liar.

42:43.600 --> 42:45.360
You're still ill,
yet you keep running around.

42:46.080 --> 42:47.720
You clearly never took
what I said seriously.

42:49.440 --> 42:51.120
I shouldn't have bothered worrying.

42:52.920 --> 42:54.080
Do as you please.

42:58.160 --> 43:00.720
Don't be angry. I know I was wrong.

43:02.560 --> 43:03.880
Where did you really go?

43:06.720 --> 43:09.760
All right. I'll tell you.

43:11.960 --> 43:15.440
Even though you've seen
all my faults for yourself,

43:16.120 --> 43:17.520
for some reason,

43:18.360 --> 43:24.680
I still want you to think of me
as someone kinder and better.

43:43.000 --> 43:44.360
I went to see Wei Shu

43:45.760 --> 43:47.560
and kick her while she was down.

43:48.360 --> 43:52.000
I enjoyed it so much
that I feel half recovered already.

43:54.800 --> 43:57.200
Come on, don't be angry.

43:57.720 --> 43:59.960
I promise I'll stay in bed and rest.

44:00.040 --> 44:01.360
No more running around.

44:10.040 --> 44:14.640
Do you realize what you just said?

44:16.080 --> 44:18.800
I promised to rest
and focus on getting well.

44:28.920 --> 44:29.800
As long as you remember.

44:32.560 --> 44:33.800
You go ahead and sleep tonight.

44:34.680 --> 44:35.800
I have something to attend to.

44:41.200 --> 44:45.720
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

45:03.360 --> 45:04.480
Come out.

45:12.400 --> 45:15.360
Don't get me wrong.
I only came to see how she's doing.

45:20.720 --> 45:21.920
I have something to ask you.

45:24.640 --> 45:27.360
BLOSSOMS OF GRACE

45:27.440 --> 45:29.880
-Lu Zhuo, actually, I came tonight…
-When a woman starts worrying

45:29.960 --> 45:32.720
about what kind of person
you think she is,

45:32.800 --> 45:33.840
what do you think it means?

45:34.520 --> 45:35.680
What?

45:35.760 --> 45:38.400
It must mean she's fallen in love.

45:40.000 --> 45:40.840
Yes.

45:40.920 --> 45:42.920
She's always been decisive.

45:43.000 --> 45:44.600
She doesn't care what others think.

45:44.680 --> 45:47.480
Why else would she start caring
unless she'd fallen in love?

45:49.000 --> 45:51.160
Yes, that must be it.

45:52.520 --> 45:55.320
If you're not sure, why not ask her?

45:56.200 --> 45:57.960
Why ask an outsider like me?

45:58.560 --> 46:00.320
No one ever loved her properly as a child.

46:00.400 --> 46:01.800
She doesn't know her own feelings.

46:01.880 --> 46:02.720
Why ask?

46:02.800 --> 46:06.040
Perhaps you're just so lovesick
you're imagining things.

46:16.960 --> 46:17.960
Who's imagining things now?

46:18.960 --> 46:21.600
This jade is naturally warm to the touch.

46:21.680 --> 46:23.600
Wearing it will keep the cold at bay.

46:28.680 --> 46:32.240
Please give it to Wei Rao for me
and wish her a speedy recovery.

46:38.240 --> 46:39.360
Thank you.

46:43.600 --> 46:45.120
Want to know if she truly loves you?

46:47.800 --> 46:49.160
Why not putting it to a test?

46:52.240 --> 46:53.080
How?

46:55.600 --> 46:56.920
Figure it out yourself.

49:11.360 --> 49:14.400
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
